[al:Sanatan & Devotional]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00][(Slow rhythmic ventilator] beep... Beep... Beep...
[00:15.47][Deep Gregorian Chant humming in background:] Hmmmm... Mmmmmm...
[00:22.94]Ra... a... a... a... (Shattering voice)
[00:30.40][(Whispers panning around the head:] Mere yaar... mere yaar...
[00:37.87]Mere yaar...
[00:45.34]Dekh mere yaar, yun... sapne mein aana chhod de..
[00:52.81]Rahya nahi jaave, mane yun satana chhod de..
[01:00.28]He Ra a a a, mere yaar pyaare,
[01:07.75]He Ra a a a..., dildaar pyaare,
[01:15.21]Tere sang sootre laage,
[01:22.68]Laage ambar saje sitare,,
[01:30.15][(Background Choir:] Libera me... Libera me...
[01:37.62]Ambar kalgi tere dheer ki,
[01:45.09]Bas tu bharosa jodh de......
[01:52.55]Nahi toh ra jaan ke pyaare, yun satana chhod de,,
[02:00.02]Dekh mere yaar, sapne mein ana chhod de,,
[02:07.49]Jeen de tu maine, yun raatein thaana chhod de,,,
[02:14.96]Kade ya kahaani teri, mere sang bahi paave,
[02:22.43]Dhoonk ya bhitar ki, tan kha jaave,
[02:29.89]Kha jaave aatma ke, dheeramdheer ne,
[02:37.36]Maati ka kaal re bande... Maati ke ameer ne..
[02:44.83]Mere yaar pyaare pyaare... mane dhap jagana chhod de!
[02:52.30]Tohi jaaun tane main sabke hi beech mein,
[02:59.77]Titli ke pankha mein tu, khet mein tu, kanka mein tu...
[03:07.24]Jeth mahine mein deh sulgana chhod de..
[03:14.70]Mit jaunga main saara... meetana chhod de...
[03:22.17]Chhod de na mere yaar......
